    {
      "bbox": [
        401,
        666,
        1323,
        711
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It has been deemed advisable to change the name of the Office of Labor Relations to more properly conform with the functions of that agency; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2391,
          "min": -1.2552
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 30,
          "mean": -0.0014,
          "min": -0.0221
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 9395,
        "area_px": 42412,
        "density": 0.22152,
        "chars": 153,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.29
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        400,
        712,
        1323,
        755
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The Mayor's Management Advisory Board has recommended a change of nomenclature for the Office of Labor Relations and the Director of Labor Relations.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.232,
          "min": -1.1313
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 30,
          "mean": -0.0009,
          "min": -0.0113
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10086,
        "area_px": 40612,
        "density": 0.24835,
        "chars": 158,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.67
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        402,
        756,
        1323,
        801
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, pursuant to the authority vested in me as Mayor of The City of New York, it is hereby ordered as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2146,
          "min": -1.2132
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 27,
          "mean": -0.0053,
          "min": -0.1428
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7093,
        "area_px": 42366,
        "density": 0.16742,
        "chars": 121,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.06
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        400,
        801,
        1324,
        886
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. The name \"Office of Labor Relations\" is hereby changed to \"Office of Municipal Labor Relations\", and the names \"Director of Labor Relations\" and \"City Director of Labor Relations\" are hereby changed to \"Director of Municipal Labor Relations\".",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2081,
          "min": -1.2205
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0342,
          "min": -0.0342
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0009,
          "min": -0.0277
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 15553,
        "area_px": 79464,
        "density": 0.19572,
        "chars": 253,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.27
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        400,
        887,
        1324,
        1087
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "§ 2. All references to (a) the Office of Labor Relations or (b) to the Director of Labor Relations or City Director of Labor Relations, including those in all Executive Orders, including, but not limited to Executive Order No. 38, dated February 7, 1967, Executive Order No. 74, dated December 15, 1976, Executive Order No. 83, dated July 26, 1973, Executive Order No. 75, dated March 22, 1973 and Executive Orders No. 98 and 99, dated October 1, 1969; and all other orders, rules, procedures, regulations or agreements governing the conduct of the City's labor relations which are subject to the jurisdiction of the Mayor shall be deemed to be references respectively (a) to the Office of Municipal Labor Relations and (b) to the Director of Municipal Labor Relations.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1755,
          "min": -0.9689
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.4288,
          "min": -0.4288
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 206,
          "mean": -0.0007,
          "min": -0.0782
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 44539,
        "area_px": 185724,
        "density": 0.23981,
        "chars": 769,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.27
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        400,
        1087,
        1324,
        1176
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "§ 3. Be it further ordered that all duties, responsibilities and authority therein conferred upon the Director of Labor Relations or the City Director of Labor Relations and upon the Office of Labor Relations shall now and henceforth devolve upon the Director of Municipal Labor Relations and the Office of Municipal Labor Relations.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1497,
          "min": -0.9705
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 59,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0068
        }
      },
      "ink": {
